classDiagram
direction LR
class Runtime {
  <<frozen dataclass>>
  +Path workspace
  +Path skill_root
  +root Path
  +output_root Path
  +path(relative) Path
  +resource(relative) Path
  +check_output_path(path)
  +bl_directory Path
  +bl_entry Path
  +prepare()
}
class Session {
  +Runtime runtime
  +dict~str,UploadRecord~ uploads
  +dict~str,Path~ output_directories
  +Draft_or_None draft
  +ConfirmationReceipt_or_None receipt
  -Lock _state_lock
  -DirectoryPicker _picker
  -Event _closed
  -set _pending_uploads
  +upload(kind, name, source, size) dict
  +uploaded(identifier, kind) dict
  +validate(payload) dict
  +confirm(validation_id) dict
  +select_directory(kind, picker_id) dict
  +cancel_directory(picker_id) dict
  +description() dict
  +api_key_display() dict
  +save_api_key(value) dict
  +cleanup()
}
class ThreadingHTTPServer
class LocalServer {
  +Session session
  +server_bind()
  +server_close()
}
class DirectoryPicker {
  -Lock _lock
  -request_id_or_None _active_id
  -Event_or_None _cancel_event
  -request_id_or_None _cancelled_id
  -bool _closed
  -Event _finished
  +select(initial, request_id) Path_or_None
  +cancel(request_id)
  +close()
}
Session --> Runtime : 持有外部传入的工作目录与资源边界
Session "1" *-- "1" DirectoryPicker : 会话创建并关闭
ThreadingHTTPServer <|-- LocalServer
LocalServer "1" *-- "1" Session : 持有会话并在关闭时清理
note for Runtime "scripts/asr_runtime/utils/environment.py<br/>resource读取Skill；path定位工作目录/.asr-transcription<br/>运行目录与Skill互不包含；check_output_path保护Skill<br/>output_root为工作目录/transcriptions"
note for Session "scripts/asr_runtime/application/session.py<br/>上传短锁登记与发布，文件字节接收在锁外<br/>Draft与ConfirmationReceipt描述普通dict字段<br/>Key通过独立方法写入当前工作目录"
note for DirectoryPicker "scripts/asr_runtime/utils/directory_picker.py<br/>choose_directory函数管理窗口子进程<br/>独立取消信号；Session登记所选精确路径"
note for LocalServer "scripts/asr_runtime/web.py<br/>create_server创建对象并绑定127.0.0.1<br/>请求处理器使用language_scope隔离提示语言"
